# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/world/spells.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@spell flame
# en: Flame
name [1551a0] = 火焰
# en: Fire from the fingertips: a candle's worth at first, a bonfire's later. Every duellist you'll ever face has it ready, and so should you.
desc [6b7da9] = 指尖生火：起初只有一根蜡烛的分量，后来是一堆篝火。你将来遇到的每个决斗者都会随时备着它，你也该如此。

@spell foresight
# en: Foresight
name [1834e4] = 预见
# en: A glimpse of the next few moments. Enough to know which way the dice will fall, sometimes.
desc [d1ae0e] = 瞥见接下来的片刻。有时，足以知道骰子会落在哪一面。

@spell mend
# en: Mend
name [c5efbd] = 愈合
# en: Knits cuts, cracks and broken teacups. Hearts take longer.
desc [fff564] = 缝合伤口、裂缝和摔碎的茶杯。心要慢一些。

@spell glamour
# en: Glamour
name [ca8c7e] = 魅影
# en: A little more charm than you really have. People remember liking you and not quite why.
desc [844244] = 比你实际拥有的多一点点魅力。人们记得喜欢你，却说不清为什么。

@spell haste
# en: Haste
name [2f6010] = 疾速
# en: Speed borrowed from hares and hawks: a blow slipped in between your spells, a parry in between everything else. It wears off quickly.
desc [be10a9] = 从野兔和鹰那里借来的速度：法术之间偷出一击，其他动作之间顺手一挡。效力去得很快。

@spell shadowstep
# en: Shadowstep
name [d5b5ab] = 影步
# en: Step into one shadow and out of another. Short distances only; the shadows in between are not friendly.
desc [c7cfde] = 踏入一片影子，从另一片影子里走出。只限短距离；中间的那些影子并不友善。

@spell ward
# en: Ward
name [a11053] = 护界
# en: A pale shell that turns aside the next harm. Every first-year is taught it in the first week, before anything else, and told to keep it close.
desc [b468c5] = 一层苍白的护壳，能挡开下一次伤害。每个新生入学第一周、先于一切学的就是它，并被叮嘱要随时备着。

@spell animate
# en: Animate
name [8e9850] = 活化
# en: A made thing gets up and moves by itself: a broom that sweeps, a chair that follows. It does one thing, and keeps doing it.
desc [96ff76] = 让一件造出来的东西自己动起来：扫地的扫帚，跟着你走的椅子。它只做一件事，并且一直做下去。

@spell starlight
# en: Starlight
name [461e3b] = 星光
# en: The light of a named star, held in the hand. Darkness that eats light finds it hard to swallow.
desc [c90510] = 一颗有名字的星星的光，握在手里。吞噬光的黑暗很难把它咽下去。

@spell seal
# en: Seal
name [7ca2c0] = 封缄
# en: Closes what is open and locks it away: a box, a door, a spell half-spent. What's sealed stays where you put it.
desc [67d898] = 把开着的东西合上、锁起来：一只盒子，一扇门，一道施了一半的咒。封住的东西，就待在你放它的地方。

@spell wildfire
# en: Wildfire
name [5e3b09] = 野火
# en: Fire you stop holding small. It grows while you hold it and runs when you let go, and it never quite forgets you're there.
desc [b334d5] = 不再被压小的火。你握着它时它会长，你松手时它会奔，而且它从来不会完全忘记你还在那儿。

@spell heartwood
# en: Heartwood
name [5a2042] = 心木
# en: A young tree out of bare ground, grown in a breath to stand over you. It shelters whoever stands under it.
desc [abc13a] = 一棵从光秃秃的地里一口气长起来的小树，立在你头顶。谁站在它下面，它就护着谁。

@spell omen
# en: Omen
name [a7197e] = 预兆
# en: Say what will happen, out loud, and it lands. Not soon; but it lands.
desc [547689] = 把将要发生的事大声说出来，它就会应验。不会很快；但会应验。

@spell sleight
# en: Sleight
name [1251ad] = 妙手
# en: Palm, swap, pocket. A coin walks out of a purse and into yours, and nobody saw a thing. It is still theft.
desc [25e378] = 藏、换、揣。一枚硬币从别人的钱袋里走进你的，谁也没看见。这仍然是偷。

@spell contraption
# en: Contraption
name [a65e7e] = 奇械
# en: A machine out of whatever is in reach, that works at once and mostly as meant. Stand back when it stops.
desc [2e81e0] = 用手边随便什么拼成一台机器，当场就能用，大致按你的意思运转。它停下来的时候，站远点。

@spell hoarfrost
# en: Hoarfrost
name [e011a7] = 白霜
# en: Cold called down hard: it freezes, cools and quenches. Set against a flame, the two of them cancel out.
desc [74903e] = 猛地唤下的寒意：能冻结、降温、扑灭。迎上一道火焰，两者会彼此抵消。

@spell candour
# en: Candour
name [926713] = 坦言
# en: Ask the right question and get the honest answer, sometimes more honest than anyone wanted.
desc [5cbfa6] = 问对问题，就能得到老实的回答，有时比任何人想要的都更老实。

@spell brace
# en: Brace
name [3cb458] = 坚守
# en: Plant your feet and hold. For a breath or two, blows that should fell you land soft.
desc [5aed1e] = 站稳脚跟，顶住。一两个呼吸之间，本该把你击倒的攻击都落得很轻。

@spell quickquill
# en: Quickquill
name [8ab1bd] = 速记羽
# en: A quill that takes it all down, word for word, as fast as anyone can talk. It has opinions about your handwriting.
desc [1ba45a] = 一支一字不落、能跟上任何人语速的羽毛笔。它对你的字迹颇有看法。

@spell bramble
# en: Bramble
name [9f2958] = 荆棘
# en: A hedge or a vine, now, where there wasn't one. The thorns are not for decoration.
desc [a5a3fd] = 一道树篱或一条藤蔓，立刻出现在原本没有的地方。那些刺可不是装饰。

@spell index
# en: Index
name [c7ae4b] = 索引
# en: Find the page. Any book you've held falls open where you need it, and a library starts to make sense.
desc [8fbe7d] = 找到那一页。你拿过的任何一本书都会翻到你需要的地方，图书馆也开始变得有道理起来。

@spell rapport
# en: Rapport
name [330eef] = 投契
# en: The right joke at the right moment. A room that was about to turn on you laughs instead.
desc [75ac2a] = 在恰好的时刻说出恰好的笑话。一屋子正要冲你发作的人，反倒笑了起来。

@spell purify
# en: Distill
name [644c98] = 萃取
# en: Draws out and concentrates: the strength from a root, the magic from yourself. It costs no Mana; it costs you.
desc [4e9fc8] = 抽取并浓缩：从根里取出力气，从你自己身上取出魔力。它不耗法力；它耗的是你。

@spell tailwind
# en: Tailwind
name [560d95] = 顺风
# en: Go fast, then faster. The wind gets behind you and keeps pushing as long as you don't stop.
desc [252b08] = 快，再快。风绕到你身后，只要你不停，它就一直推着你。

@spell rime
# en: Rime
name [853e7a] = 雾凇
# en: A sliver of winter sewn into your collar. The blow that should fell you finds you frozen instead, and you thaw.
desc [53de38] = 一片缝进衣领里的冬天。本该把你击倒的那一击，只会发现你冻住了，然后你慢慢解冻。

@spell reflect
# en: Reflect
name [70544a] = 反照
# en: What is thrown at you goes back where it came from, all of it.
desc [419257] = 朝你扔来的东西，原样回到它来的地方，一点不剩。

@spell moonwell
# en: Moonwell
name [229b68] = 月泉
# en: Sit still and let magic pool in you, like moonlight in a basin. It is slow, and it is free.
desc [ebf287] = 静坐，让魔力像月光落进水盆一样在你体内汇聚。很慢，但不要钱。

@spell lodestar
# en: Lodestar
name [85b4ab] = 引星
# en: Gather a guiding light around you, a little more each breath, until it is ready to stand between you and harm.
desc [491dd8] = 在身边聚起一团引路的光，每次呼吸多一点，直到它能挡在你和伤害之间。

@spell toll
# en: Toll
name [9908fc] = 鸣钟
# en: One low note, held, like a bell heard under water. Nobody teaches it.
desc [784cdd] = 一个低沉的音，被一直撑着，像水下听见的钟声。没有人教这个。

@spell torment
# en: Torment
name [099f12] = 折磨
# en: Every spell your opponent pays for hurts them. It is forbidden for good reason.
desc [0ddb58] = 对手每付出法力施一个法术，都会让自己吃痛。它被禁止是有道理的。

@spell extraction
# en: Extraction
name [28c060] = 汲取
# en: Reach into someone and take their magic for yours. Forbidden, and everyone who has felt it remembers.
desc [2d4e01] = 探进别人体内，把他的魔力拿来当你的。这是禁术，每个尝过它滋味的人都记得。

@spell siphon
# en: Siphon
name [2981cc] = 虹吸
# en: Draw the life out of someone, slowly, and keep it. Forbidden.
desc [8b717f] = 慢慢把别人的生命力抽出来，留给自己。禁术。

@spell compel
# en: Compel
name [dd4703] = 强令
# en: Make someone do what they just did again, and again, whether they want to or not. Forbidden.
desc [38771d] = 让人把刚做过的事再做一遍，一遍又一遍，不管他愿不愿意。禁术。

@spell eclipse
# en: Eclipse
name [412a9e] = 蚀
# en: Pain taken becomes power held. You still feel all of it. Forbidden.
desc [468617] = 承受的痛化作握在手里的力量。你依然会感受到每一分痛。禁术。

@spell heartprice
# en: Heartprice
name [fa13cc] = 心价
# en: Pay for magic with your own strength instead of Mana, for as long as you can stand it. Forbidden.
desc [da319f] = 用你自己的元气而不是法力来为魔法买单，能撑多久撑多久。禁术。
